From 093086194da25e3c5dda5ade36777430dc10e0c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Garulf <535299+Garulf@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 15:55:18 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: Implement NtQueryDirectoryFile() on the named pipe
 root directory.

Add a get_named_pipe_entries server request that walks the pipe names
of the named pipe device. The search expression and the scan position
are kept with the directory file object, so FindFirstFile("\\.\pipe\*")
and FindNextFile() list the existing pipes.

Wine-Bug: https://bugs.winehq.org/show_bug.cgi?id=55485
